### 1. Exportar todas as certidões da organização
POST {{host}}/certificates/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Exportar só as trabalhistas de um CNPJ
POST {{host}}/certificates/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 3,
  "document_cnpj": "11222333000181"
}

### 3. Acompanhar o runner (document_url chega quando finished = true)
GET {{host}}/certificates/export/runner/{{runner_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Listar paginado
GET {{host}}/certificates?page=1&rows=20&type=1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
